``` SR-05 | Dispatch Directory Bloat
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry SR-05. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH-local for the artifact breakdown, SH for the warnings.
    Query: Main query
    If this returns nothing, run probes/SR-05-probe.spl,
    probes/SR-05-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/search/jobs count=0
| eval disk_mb=diskUsage / 1024 / 1024,
       ttl_h=round(ttl / 3600, 1),
       kind=case(isSavedSearch=1, "scheduled", like(sid, "rt_%"), "realtime",
                 true(), "ad-hoc")
| stats count as artifacts round(sum(disk_mb), 1) as total_mb
        round(max(disk_mb), 1) as largest_mb max(ttl_h) as max_ttl_h
        by author kind label
| sort - total_mb
| head 25
